  shortDescription: Locks one placed block floating mid-air permanently.
  description: Select a block inside your tower and sever its relationship with gravity.
    That specific block locks permanently into its current screen coordinates, remaining
    frozen in mid-air even if every single block supporting it underneath is removed
    or destroyed.
